            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Tenant owners can directly forge worker read confirmations\n\nDirect writes can set worker snapshot, method, and read_at without recipient proof.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Improper authorization\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-863\n\nRemediation:\nUse a trusted session-bound confirmation function.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Negative case fails closed and valid path remains functional.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant at the database, transaction, or trusted edge boundary."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:97a76bede54a670316d48b724b13e0aa9ef3e0526c872d04467742df5c1c1fed"
          },
          "properties": {
