                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Direct improvement writes can forge approval provenance\n\nTenant owners can directly set review_status, approved_by, and approved_at.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Improper authorization\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-863\n\nRemediation:\nMake approval fields service-only.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Negative case fails closed and valid path remains functional.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant at the database, transaction, or trusted edge boundary."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:4dd801b75c6ee6c2ec821499fe8dd34eb8a9f3e8054df6a5cb823ee47d3a2079"
