          "message": {
            "text": "Public provider diagnostics expose bounded upstream failure details\n\nProvider exception or bounded response text reaches public ask status detail.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Information exposure\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-209\n\nRemediation:\nReturn stable public codes and keep diagnostics server-side.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Negative case fails closed and valid path remains functional.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant at the database, transaction, or trusted edge boundary."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
