          "message": {
            "text": "Tenant-owned rows can forge cross-tenant related-object bindings\n\nOwner policies validate organization_id but do not tenant-bind referenced object identifiers.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Tenant integrity\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-639\n\nRemediation:\nAdd composite tenant constraints or trusted validation functions.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Negative case fails closed and valid path remains functional.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant at the database, transaction, or trusted edge boundary."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:aa28c6dad7cc60f7344a2035da0ddee885446c6665952f32f9f4a80ac13ad8d4"
          },
          "properties": {
            "category": "Tenant integrity",
            "confidence": "high",
            "findingId": "csf_6d82c0e91784deac7d835be8",
            "occurrenceId": "occ_b47e5c78798d4afd634473fe",
            "severity": "low"
          },
          "ruleId": "tenant-integrity.related-object-binding",
          "ruleIndex": 15
        },
