                  "startLine": 76
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "NULL dispatch-log tenants bypass row-level authorization\n\ndispatch_logs permits organization_id IS NULL in both USING and WITH CHECK.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Authorization bypass\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-863\n\nRemediation:\nDisallow unowned tenant rows and isolate service audit records.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Negative case fails closed and valid path remains functional.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant at the database, transaction, or trusted edge boundary."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:da0a168bdbc9673f10aa8d674c6cbf2aaf1b51bda82ee4b5089f0813864439b7"
          },
          "properties": {
