                "text": "sink"
              },
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "app/api/workers/route.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "endLine": 120,
                  "startLine": 84
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Worker site-binding check races with upsert\n\nExisting bindings are read and later upserted separately.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Race condition\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-362\n\nRemediation:\nEnforce binding invariants atomically.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Negative case fails closed and valid path remains functional.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant at the database, transaction, or trusted edge boundary."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:e436216a81155fea9617a3874c0e46626236d342b52bfefeebbfd51bb6565898"
          },
