                  "startLine": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Published safety-reference tables expose raw catalog rows publicly\n\nPublic read policies target raw catalog and ingestion tables.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Information exposure\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-200\n\nRemediation:\nExpose a minimal curated public view.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Negative case fails closed and valid path remains functional.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant at the database, transaction, or trusted edge boundary."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:4de7886f188de27e0d0db71ba0fde1ca95f86e9858531a35fff722ca9d6a2438"
