          "message": {
            "text": "MCP token quota uses a check-then-insert race\n\nActive tokens are counted and inserted in separate statements.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Race condition\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-362\n\nRemediation:\nReserve quota atomically.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Negative case fails closed and valid path remains functional.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant at the database, transaction, or trusted edge boundary."
